# SafeReturn checks out with LF line endings on every platform.
# Golden JSON fixtures are compared byte-for-byte in tests; a CRLF
# checkout on Windows (git autocrlf) made them "drift" in CI run #2
# even though the content was identical. Pin LF so a fixture's bytes
# mean the same thing everywhere. Binary files are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
